<decision #track.add_unified_resource_upgrade.command apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { priority = "P0" status = "accepted" durable_candidate = true confidence = 1 reversibility = "easy" } (
  <question ?01M04TF0CAY1JM2XNSFEVP4XSM>
  单资源升级是否使用统一高层命令，同时保留 migrate 四阶段诊断接口？
  </?01M04TF0CAY1JM2XNSFEVP4XSM>
  <recommendation ?01M04TF0CB7Y4JBGFRS5CA881Z>
  新增 `codument upgrade-resource &lt;path&gt;`，内部复用现有 migration registry。
  </?01M04TF0CB7Y4JBGFRS5CA881Z>
  <answer {  } (
    <raw-answer ?01M04TF0CB7Y4JBGFRS5CA8820>
    同意使用 codument upgrade-resource &lt;path&gt;，现有 migrate 四阶段命令保留为底层诊断接口。
    </?01M04TF0CB7Y4JBGFRS5CA8820>
    <decision-text ?01M04TF0CB7Y4JBGFRS5CA8821>
    提供一条自动 inspect、plan、backup、apply、verify 的单资源升级命令。
    </?01M04TF0CB7Y4JBGFRS5CA8821>
    <rationale ?01M04TF0CB7Y4JBGFRS5CA8822>
    普通升级不应要求用户手工编排四阶段，但诊断和 AI 修订仍需要分阶段接口。
    </?01M04TF0CB7Y4JBGFRS5CA8822>
    <evidence ?01M04TF0CB7Y4JBGFRS5CA8823>
    用户在本次 mission 续跑前明确确认该方案。
    </?01M04TF0CB7Y4JBGFRS5CA8823>
  )>
)>

<decision #track.add_unified_resource_upgrade.decision_owner apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { priority = "P0" status = "accepted" durable_candidate = true confidence = 1 reversibility = "moderate" } (
  <question ?01M04TF0CB7Y4JBGFRS5CA8824>
  长期 Decision Registry 如何确定业务 owner，并处理缺少 owner 的根 durable decision？
  </?01M04TF0CB7Y4JBGFRS5CA8824>
  <recommendation ?01M04TF0CB7Y4JBGFRS5CA8825>
  递归业务路径原样晋升；根 durable decision 缺 owner 时交 AI；取消 registry.xnl fallback。
  </?01M04TF0CB7Y4JBGFRS5CA8825>
  <answer {  } (
    <raw-answer ?01M04TF0CB7Y4JBGFRS5CA8826>
    同意递归业务路径原样晋升，根 durable decision 缺少归属时交给 AI，彻底取消 registry.xnl fallback。
    </?01M04TF0CB7Y4JBGFRS5CA8826>
    <decision-text ?01M04TF0CB7Y4JBGFRS5CA8827>
    长期 Decision 使用业务语义 XNL 目录树；CLI 不再把未知归属写进 registry.xnl。
    </?01M04TF0CB7Y4JBGFRS5CA8827>
    <rationale ?01M04TF0CB7Y4JBGFRS5CA8828>
    通用聚合文件丢失维护语义，而 AI 可以基于完整上下文选择稳定业务 owner。
    </?01M04TF0CB7Y4JBGFRS5CA8828>
    <evidence ?01M04TF0CB7Y4JBGFRS5CA8829>
    历史 Track 设计已要求 owner-or-topic/subtopic 结构，用户再次确认该不变量。
    </?01M04TF0CB7Y4JBGFRS5CA8829>
  )>
)>

<decision #track.add_unified_resource_upgrade.remove_legacy_markdown apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { priority = "P0" status = "accepted" durable_candidate = true confidence = 1 reversibility = "moderate" } (
  <question ?01M04TF0CB7Y4JBGFRS5CA882A>
  legacy decision.md/decisions.md 的清理范围是否包括 archived Track？
  </?01M04TF0CB7Y4JBGFRS5CA882A>
  <recommendation ?01M04TF0CB7Y4JBGFRS5CA882B>
  包括 archived Track；先保真迁入 XNL 与备份，再移除 Markdown。
  </?01M04TF0CB7Y4JBGFRS5CA882B>
  <answer {  } (
    <raw-answer ?01M04TF0CB7Y4JBGFRS5CA882C>
    包括。
    </?01M04TF0CB7Y4JBGFRS5CA882C>
    <decision-text ?01M04TF0CB7Y4JBGFRS5CA882D>
    项目 Codument 资产中不再保留 Decision Markdown，包括历史 archive。
    </?01M04TF0CB7Y4JBGFRS5CA882D>
    <rationale ?01M04TF0CB7Y4JBGFRS5CA882E>
